 "Breadnut Corner Ready Plan. 1. Know your risk. Is your home safe in a hurricane? Is it near water? 2. Make a family plan. Where will we go? Who will we call? 3. Keep a kit. Water, food, a torch, a radio, medicine and papers. 4. Fix the roof early. Strong straps and nails help it stay on. 5. Listen to the official warnings, and leave early if you are told to.": "n-3fff1231.mp3",
